<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>404 - Halaman Tidak Ditemukan</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/tailwind.css">
    <link href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0/css/all.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
</head>
<body class="min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center p-6 bg-gradient-to-br from-dark-900 via-dark-800 to-coffee-900 text-center">
    <div class="max-w-md">
        <div class="text-7xl mb-4 text-brown-400"><i class="fas fa-exclamation-triangle"></i></div>
        <h1 class="text-8xl font-bold text-brown-600 mb-2">404</h1>
        <h2 class="text-xl text-white mb-2">Halaman tidak ditemukan</h2>
        <p class="text-brown-300 mb-6">Halaman yang Anda cari tidak ada atau telah dipindahkan.</p>
        <div class="flex gap-3 justify-center">
            <a href="/admin/dashboard" class="px-5 py-2 bg-brown-600 hover:bg-brown-500 text-white rounded-lg font-medium transition">
                <i class="fas fa-home mr-2"></i>Dashboard
            </a>
            <a href="javascript:history.back()" class="px-5 py-2 bg-dark-800 hover:bg-dark-700 text-brown-300 border border-brown-600/30 rounded-lg font-medium transition">
                <i class="fas fa-arrow-left mr-2"></i>Kembali
            </a>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
